// DebugDiva RAG 评测集 v3：100 题。语料与许可见 SOURCES.md，格式见 ../README.md
// 题型配比：factual 30 / keyword 20 / multi_section 14 / follow_up 8 / paraphrase 18 / no_answer 10
// factual
{"id":"f01","type":"factual","question":"JavaScript 什么时候会抛出 too much recursion？","answer":"出现过于深层的递归或无尽递归（缺少终止条件）时。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"当出现过于深层的递归或无尽递归时，JavaScript 将会抛出此错误"}]}
{"id":"f02","type":"factual","question":"为什么 JS 数组长度不能超过 2^32 - 1？","answer":"Array 和 ArrayBuffer 的 length 被定义为 32 位无符号整数。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"Array 和 ArrayBuffer 的 length（长度）属性被定义为一个 32 位无符号整形"}]}
{"id":"f03","type":"factual","question":"页面报 $ is not defined，用的是 jQuery，可能是什么原因？","answer":"库还没加载就访问了 $；应把加载 jQuery 的 script 放在使用它的代码之前。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在加载库（例如 jQuery）时，确保在访问库变量（例如“$”）之前先加载该库"}]}
{"id":"f04","type":"factual","question":"用 for...of 遍历一个普通对象报错，应该怎么改？","answer":"普通对象不可迭代，改用 Object.keys 或 Object.entries（或改用 Map）。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"作为替代，你必须使用 Object.keys 或 Object.entries 来迭代对象的属性或属性值"}]}
{"id":"f05","type":"factual","question":"哪些 JavaScript 内置对象不能用 new 调用？","answer":"Math、JSON、Symbol、Reflect、Intl、SIMD、Atomics；生成器函数也不能作为构造器。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"下面的 JavaScript 标准内置对象都不是构造函数：Math、JSON、Symbol、Reflect、Intl"}]}
{"id":"f06","type":"factual","question":"给 const 声明的变量重新赋值报错了，如果确实需要可变变量该怎么声明？","answer":"不要用 const，改用 let 声明块作用域变量（或 var）。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"可以使用 `let` 关键字来声明一个拥有块作用域的变量"}]}
{"id":"f07","type":"factual","question":"return 后面换行再写表达式，为什么那行代码不会执行？","answer":"省略分号时 return 后直接返回，下一行表达式不可达，会出现 unreachable code 警告。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在省略分号的 return 语句之后直接跟随一个表达式"}]}
{"id":"f08","type":"factual","question":"Node.js 默认收集多少层调用栈？能改吗？","answer":"Error.stackTraceLimit 默认 10，可设为任意有效数字，只影响修改之后捕获的栈。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"The default value is `10` but may be set to any valid JavaScript number"}]}
{"id":"f09","type":"factual","question":"启动 Node 服务时报 EADDRINUSE 是什么意思？","answer":"端口/地址已被本机其他服务占用，绑定失败。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EADDRINUSE` (Address already in use): An attempt to bind a server"}]}
{"id":"f10","type":"factual","question":"Node 报 EMFILE 打开文件过多，怎么临时解决？","answer":"在运行 Node 进程的同一 shell 中执行 ulimit -n 2048 提高文件描述符上限。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"To remedy a low limit, run `ulimit -n 2048` in the same shell"}]}
{"id":"f11","type":"factual","question":"现在 require() 一个 ES 模块还会报 ERR_REQUIRE_ESM 吗？","answer":"不会，该错误已废弃，require() 已支持加载同步 ES 模块；含顶层 await 时改抛 ERR_REQUIRE_ASYNC_MODULE。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"This error has been deprecated since `require()` now supports loading synchronous"}]}
{"id":"f12","type":"factual","question":"捕获到 ERR_INVALID_URL 时，怎么知道是哪个 URL 解析失败？","answer":"错误对象通常带有 input 属性，包含解析失败的 URL。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"The thrown error object typically has an additional property `'input'`"}]}
{"id":"f13","type":"factual","question":"POST 接口永久迁移，应该返回 301 还是别的状态码？","answer":"建议用 308，因为它禁止更改请求方法；301 最好只用于 GET/HEAD。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"而对于 POST 则改用 308 Permanent Redirect，因为此状态码会禁止更改请求方法"}]}
{"id":"f14","type":"factual","question":"返回 304 时响应里必须带哪些头？","answer":"不能有主体，且须包含等价 200 响应会带的 Cache-Control、Content-Location、Date、ETag、Expires、Vary。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"该响应必须不包含主体，并且必须包含在等价 200 OK 响应中会带有的 Cache-Control"}]}
{"id":"f15","type":"factual","question":"Payload Too Large 和 413 Content Too Large 是什么关系？","answer":"同一个状态码，RFC 9110 之前短语叫 Payload Too Large。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"在 RFC 9110 标准之前，该响应的短语为 Payload Too Large"}]}
{"id":"f16","type":"factual","question":"410 响应会被缓存吗？","answer":"会，410 默认会被缓存。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"410 响应默认会被缓存"}]}
{"id":"f17","type":"factual","question":"BigInt 做除法时除数是 0n 会发生什么？","answer":"抛出 RangeError: BigInt division by zero。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"如果除数为 `0n` 则会触发该错误"}]}
{"id":"f18","type":"factual","question":"Number.prototype.toString 的 radix 参数允许取哪些值？","answer":"2 到 36 之间的整数。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"参数被指定，但其值不在 2 到 36 之间时触发"}]}
{"id":"f19","type":"factual","question":"什么情况下 JavaScript 会报 invalid date？","answer":"给 Date 或 Date.parse() 传入会导致无效日期的字符串。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"为 Date 或 Date.parse() 提供了一个会导致无效日期的字符串"}]}
{"id":"f20","type":"factual","question":"给不可扩展的对象添加新属性，严格模式和非严格模式下分别会怎样？","answer":"严格模式抛出 TypeError，非严格模式静默忽略。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在严格模式下，向已经标记为不可扩展的对象添加新属性会报 TypeError 错误。而在非严格模式下，添加属性“x”会被静默忽略。"}]}
{"id":"f21","type":"factual","question":"JavaScript 标识符可以用数字开头吗？","answer":"不可以，只能以字母、下划线或 $ 开头。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"当标识符以数字开头时，JavaScript 会出现“identifier starts immediately after numeric literal”的异常"}]}
{"id":"f22","type":"factual","question":"在函数外面写 return 会报什么错？","answer":"SyntaxError: return not in function。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"当 `return` 语句在函数外部被调用时"}]}
{"id":"f23","type":"factual","question":"HTTP 409 Conflict 表示什么？","answer":"请求与服务器端目标资源的当前状态相冲突。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"表示请求与服务器端目标资源的当前状态相冲突"}]}
{"id":"f24","type":"factual","question":"服务器返回 411 是什么原因？","answer":"请求缺少确定的 Content-Length 首部。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"由于缺少确定的Content-Length 首部字段"}]}
{"id":"f25","type":"factual","question":"416 Range Not Satisfiable 是什么意思？","answer":"服务器无法处理所请求的数据区间，通常是区间超出了文件大小。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"错误状态码意味着服务器无法处理所请求的数据区间"}]}
{"id":"f26","type":"factual","question":"422 Unprocessable Entity 和普通的格式错误有什么不同？","answer":"请求的内容类型和语法都正确，但服务器无法处理其中的指令。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"服务器理解请求实体的内容类型，并且请求实体的语法是正确的"}]}
{"id":"f27","type":"factual","question":"HTTP 451 状态码代表什么？","answer":"因法律原因不可用。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"因法律原因不可用"}]}
{"id":"f28","type":"factual","question":"511 Network Authentication Required 通常在什么场景出现？","answer":"客户端需要先认证才能获得网络访问权限，例如公共 Wi-Fi 的认证页。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"表示客户端需要进行认证才能获得网络访问权限"}]}
{"id":"f29","type":"factual","question":"Node.js 报 EACCES 是什么意思？","answer":"权限被拒绝：以文件访问权限不允许的方式访问文件。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EACCES` (Permission denied): An attempt was made to access a file in a way"}]}
{"id":"f30","type":"factual","question":"Node.js 的 EISDIR 错误表示什么？","answer":"操作期望的是文件，但给定的路径是目录。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EISDIR` (Is a directory): An operation expected a file, but the given"}]}
// keyword
{"id":"k01","type":"keyword","question":"JSON.parse(\"[1, 2, 3, 4, ]\") 报 unexpected character，为什么？","answer":"JSON 不允许末尾多余的逗号，去掉即可。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"不允许在末尾添加多余的逗号"}]}
{"id":"k02","type":"keyword","question":"TypeError: Converting circular structure to JSON 怎么回事？","answer":"对象存在循环引用，JSON 不支持，JSON.stringify 直接失败；可用 replacer 过滤或专用库。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"JSON.stringify() 并不会尝试解决这个问题而是直接运行失败"}]}
{"id":"k03","type":"keyword","question":"TypeError: Reduce of empty array with no initial value 如何修复？","answer":"给 reduce 提供初始值（加法用 0、乘法用 1 等），或调用前处理空数组。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"一种是提供一个初始值作为操作符的中立元素"}]}
{"id":"k04","type":"keyword","question":"decodeURIComponent 报 URIError: URI malformed 是什么原因？","answer":"传给编解码函数的参数不合法（如残缺的转义序列或不成对的代理字符）。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"传递给 decodeURI、encodeURI、encodeURIComponent 或 decodeURIComponent 函数的参数不合法"}]}
{"id":"k05","type":"keyword","question":"Express 里报 ERR_HTTP_HEADERS_SENT 是什么意思？","answer":"响应头已发送后又尝试设置响应头（常见于重复 res.send）。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to add more headers after the headers had already been sent."}]}
{"id":"k06","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_STREAM_WRITE_AFTER_END 是怎么触发的？","answer":"在 stream.end() 之后又调用了 stream.write()。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to call `stream.write()` after `stream.end()` has been"}]}
{"id":"k07","type":"keyword","question":"child_process.exec 报 ERR_CHILD_PROCESS_STDIO_MAXBUFFER 怎么办？","answer":"子进程输出超过 maxBuffer，需调大 maxBuffer 或改用流式 spawn。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"and the data's length is longer than the `maxBuffer` option"}]}
{"id":"k08","type":"keyword","question":"Math.max(2, 42,) 报 SyntaxError: Unexpected token，为什么？","answer":"该处函数调用不允许尾随逗号，去掉最后的逗号或补一个参数。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在调用函数时，不允许使用尾随逗号"}]}
{"id":"k09","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_SOCKET_ALREADY_BOUND 是什么时候抛出的？","answer":"对已经绑定的 socket 再次 bind。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to bind a socket that has already been bound."}]}
{"id":"k10","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_STREAM_CANNOT_PIPE 是什么错误？","answer":"在 Writable 流上调用了 stream.pipe()。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to call `stream.pipe()` on a `Writable` stream."}]}
{"id":"k11","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_STRING_TOO_LONG 什么情况下会出现？","answer":"尝试创建超过最大允许长度的字符串。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt has been made to create a string longer than the maximum allowed"}]}
{"id":"k12","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_CONSTRUCT_CALL_REQUIRED 是怎么回事？","answer":"类的构造函数没有用 new 调用。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"A constructor for a class was called without `new`."}]}
{"id":"k13","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_ILLEGAL_CONSTRUCTOR 是什么意思？","answer":"用非公开的构造函数创建对象。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to construct an object using a non-public constructor."}]}
{"id":"k14","type":"keyword","question":"http.request 报 ERR_INVALID_PROTOCOL 怎么回事？","answer":"传给 http.request() 的 options.protocol 无效。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An invalid `options.protocol` was passed to `http.request()`."}]}
{"id":"k15","type":"keyword","question":"ERR_UNKNOWN_MODULE_FORMAT 是什么原因？","answer":"加载的模块格式未知或不受支持。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to load a module with an unknown or unsupported format."}]}
{"id":"k16","type":"keyword","question":"SyntaxError: invalid assignment left-hand side 一般是怎么写错的？","answer":"在条件判断里把 == / === 写成了单个 =。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"当使用单个 `=` 符号而不是 `==` 或 `===` 时"}]}
{"id":"k17","type":"keyword","question":"TypeError: invalid Array.prototype.sort argument 什么时候报？","answer":"传给 sort() 的比较函数既不是函数也不是 undefined。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"JavaScript 异常“invalid Array.prototype.sort argument”会在 Array.prototype.sort() 方法"}]}
{"id":"k18","type":"keyword","question":"ReferenceError: assignment to undeclared variable \"x\" 是什么错误？","answer":"严格模式下给未声明的变量赋值。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在代码里赋值了一个未声明的变量。换句话说，有处没有带着 `var` 关键字的赋值。"}]}
{"id":"k19","type":"keyword","question":"Warning: unreachable code after return statement 是怎么产生的？","answer":"return 之后还有语句，或无分号的 return 后直接跟表达式。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"当在 return 语句之后使用别的语句，或在无分号返回语句之后直接在后面跟随表达式"}]}
{"id":"k20","type":"keyword","question":"Node.js 报 ENOTEMPTY 是什么意思？","answer":"目标目录非空，例如对有内容的目录调用 rmdir。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`ENOTEMPTY` (Directory not empty): A directory with entries was the target"}]}
// multi_section
{"id":"m01","type":"multi_section","question":"401 和 403 有什么区别？","answer":"401 缺少有效认证凭证，重新认证可能成功；403 服务器拒绝授权，重新认证也不会改变。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"这个状态类似于 403，但是在该情况下，依然可以进行身份验证"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"但进入 403状态后即使重新验证也不会改变该状态"}]}
{"id":"m02","type":"multi_section","question":"Nginx 返回 502 和 504 分别说明什么问题？","answer":"502 网关从上游收到无效响应；504 网关在规定时间内没等到上游响应。都需在服务端/代理侧修复。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"从上游服务器中接收到的响应是无效的"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"无法在规定的时间内获得想要的响应"}]}
{"id":"m03","type":"multi_section","question":"资源删除后应该返回 404 还是 410？","answer":"确定永久删除用 410；不确定是临时还是永久就用 404。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"如果服务器知道该资源是永久丢失，那么应该返回 410"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"说明请求的目标资源在原服务器上不存在了，并且是永久性的丢失"}]}
{"id":"m04","type":"multi_section","question":"fetch 接口后调用 response.json() 报 JSON.parse 语法错误，接口其实返回了 404 页面，这两者有什么联系？","answer":"404 表示资源不存在，服务器返回的往往是 HTML 错误页；把它当 JSON 解析就会因语法错误而抛错。应先检查状态码。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"指的是服务器无法找到所请求的资源"},{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"这个字符串被检测出错误语法的时候将会抛出错误"}]}
{"id":"m05","type":"multi_section","question":"Node 请求下游服务时 ECONNREFUSED 和 ETIMEDOUT 分别意味着什么？","answer":"ECONNREFUSED 对方主动拒绝，通常服务未启动；ETIMEDOUT 对方一段时间内未正确响应。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"This usually results from trying to connect to a service that is inactive on the foreign host"},{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"the connected party did not properly respond after a period of time"}]}
{"id":"m06","type":"multi_section","question":"\"x is not defined\" 和 \"can't access lexical declaration before initialization\" 有什么区别？","answer":"前者引用了不存在/不在作用域内的变量；后者变量用 let/const 声明了但在初始化前被访问（暂时性死区）。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"在某处引用了一个不存在的变量"},{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"词法变量在初始化之前被访问"}]}
{"id":"m07","type":"multi_section","question":"在 Node 里 require() 一个带顶层 await 的 ES 模块会报什么错？","answer":"报 ERR_REQUIRE_ASYNC_MODULE（ERR_REQUIRE_ESM 已废弃），因为该模块是异步的。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"it will throw `ERR_REQUIRE_ASYNC_MODULE` instead"},{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"When trying to `require()` an ES Module, the module turns out to be asynchronous"}]}
{"id":"m08","type":"multi_section","question":"服务端被限流和停机维护时，都可以用哪个响应头告诉客户端多久后重试？","answer":"Retry-After：429 用它提示等待时间，503 用它给出预期恢复时间。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"可以提供一个 Retry-After 首部来提示用户需要等待多长时间之后再发送新的请求"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"应该在 Retry-After 首部字段中包含服务恢复的预期时间"}]}
{"id":"m09","type":"multi_section","question":"408 Request Timeout 和 504 Gateway Timeout 都是超时，有什么区别？","answer":"408 是服务器要关闭空闲连接；504 是网关等不到上游响应。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"表示服务器想要将没有在使用的连接关闭"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"无法在规定的时间内获得想要的响应"}]}
{"id":"m10","type":"multi_section","question":"Node.js 里 EACCES 和 EPERM 有什么区别？","answer":"EACCES 是文件权限不允许该访问方式；EPERM 是操作需要更高权限。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EACCES` (Permission denied): An attempt was made to access a file in a way"},{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EPERM` (Operation not permitted): An attempt was made to perform an"}]}
{"id":"m11","type":"multi_section","question":"ENOENT 和 ENOTDIR 分别在什么情况下出现？","answer":"ENOENT 是路径某部分不存在；ENOTDIR 是路径某部分存在但不是目录。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"Commonly raised by `fs` operations\n  to indicate that a component of the specified pathname does not exist"},{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`ENOTDIR` (Not a directory): A component of the given pathname existed, but"}]}
{"id":"m12","type":"multi_section","question":"415 和 422 都和请求体有关，区别是什么？","answer":"415 是不支持载荷格式；422 是格式和语法正确但无法处理其中的指令。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"表示服务器由于不支持其有效载荷的格式"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"服务器理解请求实体的内容类型，并且请求实体的语法是正确的"}]}
{"id":"m13","type":"multi_section","question":"201 Created 和 202 Accepted 有什么区别？","answer":"201 表示已处理并创建了资源；202 表示已接受但处理尚未完成。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"表示请求已经被成功处理，并且创建了新的资源"},{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"成功响应状态码表示请求已被接受处理，但处理尚未完成或可能尚未开始"}]}
{"id":"m14","type":"multi_section","question":"ERR_STREAM_WRITE_AFTER_END 和 ERR_STREAM_CANNOT_PIPE 分别是什么误用？","answer":"前者是 end() 之后又 write()；后者是在 Writable 流上调用 pipe()。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to call `stream.write()` after `stream.end()` has been"},{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to call `stream.pipe()` on a `Writable` stream."}]}
