{"id":"u01","type":"follow_up","history":[{"role":"user","content":"Node.js 里 EMFILE 是什么错误？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"表示打开的文件描述符达到系统上限，通常是并发打开了太多文件。"}],"question":"为什么在 macOS 上更容易遇到？","answer":"macOS 等系统给进程的文件描述符上限较低。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"especially on systems (in particular, macOS) where there is a low file descriptor limit for processes"}]}
{"id":"u02","type":"follow_up","history":[{"role":"user","content":"JSON.parse 报错一般是什么原因？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"传入的字符串不是合法 JSON，比如末尾多了逗号。"}],"question":"那属性名用单引号可以吗？","answer":"不可以，属性名必须用双引号。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"属性名上不能使用单引号"}]}
{"id":"u03","type":"follow_up","history":[{"role":"user","content":"301 和 302 有什么区别？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"301 是永久重定向，302 是临时重定向。"}],"question":"那后者对 SEO 有什么影响？","answer":"搜索引擎不会把原 URL 的链接权重归给新 URL，不传递 SEO 值。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"不会将原始 URL 的链接归属于新资源，这意味着不会将任何 SEO 值传递给新 URL"}]}
{"id":"u04","type":"follow_up","history":[{"role":"user","content":"reduce 报 Reduce of empty array with no initial value 是怎么回事？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"对空数组调用 reduce 且没有提供初始值。"}],"question":"什么情况下数组会意外变成空的？","answer":"例如先 filter 把所有元素都过滤掉了，或选择器有误导致没有元素。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"可能会出现列表中所有元素被移除的情况"}]}
{"id":"u05","type":"follow_up","question":"那如果是没有权限呢？","history":[{"role":"user","content":"Node 用 fs 读文件时，路径不存在会报什么错？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"ENOENT，表示路径中的某一部分不存在。"}],"answer":"EACCES（Permission denied）。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"`EACCES` (Permission denied): An attempt was made to access a file in a way"}]}
{"id":"u06","type":"follow_up","question":"它可能会带上哪个响应头？","history":[{"role":"user","content":"HTTP 413 是什么意思？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"请求主体超过了服务器愿意或能够处理的大小。"}],"answer":"可能关闭连接，或返回 Retry-After 头。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-http-status.pdf","quote":"服务器可能会关闭连接或返回 Retry-After 标头字段"}]}
{"id":"u07","type":"follow_up","question":"那非严格模式下呢？","history":[{"role":"user","content":"TypeError: can't define property \"x\": \"obj\" is not extensible 是怎么回事？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"对象被 Object.preventExtensions() 标记为不可扩展后又添加属性，严格模式下抛出 TypeError。"}],"answer":"静默忽略，不会报错。","evidence":[{"doc":"mdn-js-errors.md","quote":"而在非严格模式下，添加属性“x”会被静默忽略。"}]}
{"id":"u08","type":"follow_up","question":"那在 Writable 流上调用 pipe 呢？","history":[{"role":"user","content":"ERR_STREAM_WRITE_AFTER_END 是怎么触发的？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"在 stream.end() 之后又调用了 stream.write()。"}],"answer":"ERR_STREAM_CANNOT_PIPE。","evidence":[{"doc":"node-errors.md","quote":"An attempt was made to call `stream.pipe()` on a `Writable` stream."}]}
